# Copy to .env and fill in. The two LLM measures (Argument graph, Figure exposition) need a language model.
# 1) A LiteLLM proxy gateway (used when LITELLM_PROXY_API_BASE is set), e.g. the UMN AI gateway:
LITELLM_PROXY_API_BASE=https://api.aigateway.umn.edu
LITELLM_PROXY_API_KEY=
SCISLOP_MODEL=gpt-5.6-luna
# 2) Or OpenRouter (used when no gateway is set):
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
# SCISLOP_MODEL=openai/gpt-5.6-luna
# 3) Or any OpenAI-compatible endpoint (e.g. local vLLM):
# SCISLOP_LLM_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000/v1
# SCISLOP_REASONING=low
